&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;改訂の概要&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 0px none #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px none #000000; border-bottom: 0px none #000000; width: 94.53333333333333333333333333px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;IAS第12号&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 6px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: center"&gt;（改訂）&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="border-left: 0px none #000000; border-top: 0px none #000000; border-right: 0px none #000000; border-bottom: 0px none #000000; width: 15.6px; vertical-align: middle; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px"&gt;
